msgstr "Què diu la prova"

#: src/pages/transition/PublicsPanel.tsx
msgid "What the proof makes public about this batch (its <0>public values</0>): the state it started from and ended at, how many votes it carried, which list of voters it used and whether every check passed. The registry reads most of them and refuses the batch if one is wrong; the rest help diagnose a failure."
msgstr "El que la prova fa públic sobre aquest lot (els seus <0>valors públics</0>): l'estat del qual va partir i al qual va arribar, quants vots portava, quina llista de votants va fer servir i si va superar totes les comprovacions. El registre en llegeix la majoria i rebutja el lot si n'hi ha un d'incorrecte; la resta ajuden a diagnosticar una fallada."

#: src/pages/transition/PublicsPanel.tsx
msgid "The proven program (the zkVM guest) ends by committing 46 registers of 32 bits. A ZisK proof carries 64, the rest zero, and they travel on the chain as the 512-byte <0>publicValues</0>, one 8-byte little-endian word per register. Register names are the ones in davinci-zkvm <1>circuit/CIRCUIT.md</1> §3."
msgstr "Al final, el programa de la prova (el guest de la zkVM) fa públics 46 registres de 32 bits. Una prova de ZisK en porta 64, la resta a zero, i viatgen a la cadena com els 512 bytes de <0>publicValues</0>, una paraula little-endian de 8 bytes per registre. Els noms dels registres són els de davinci-zkvm <1>circuit/CIRCUIT.md</1> §3."

#: src/pages/transition/PublicsPanel.tsx
msgid "Register"
msgstr "Registre"

#: src/pages/transition/PublicsPanel.tsx
